---
import BaseHead from '../../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
  <BaseHead
    title="Case Study: Scalare i Ricavi attraverso l'Affiliate Marketing — Stratagem"
    description="Come un brand di design ha ottenuto +265% di tasso di conversione, +14,6% di AOV e un ROAS di 16x grazie a una strategia di affiliate marketing orientata alla performance."
  />
</head>
<body class="bg-white text-gray-900">
  <Header />
  <main>

    <!-- ─── HERO ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="bg-[#0a1228] pt-32 pb-24 relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 relative">

        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600/10 border border-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-7">
          Case Study
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-white leading-tight mb-6 max-w-4xl">
          Scalare i Ricavi di Qualità attraverso l'Affiliate Marketing
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-12 max-w-3xl">
          Come un brand di design leader ha ottenuto tassi di conversione più elevati, un AOV più alto
          e un ROAS di 16x grazie a una strategia di affiliate marketing orientata alla performance
        </p>

        <!-- KPI Bar -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-10 pt-10 border-t border-white/10 mb-12">
          <div>
            <div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-1.5">+265%</div>
            <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-blue-300 font-medium">Tasso di Conversione</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-1.5">+14,6%</div>
            <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-blue-300 font-medium">Valore Medio Ordine</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-1.5">16x</div>
            <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-blue-300 font-medium">ROAS</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a href="/it/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl transition-colors duration-200 shadow-lg shadow-blue-900/40">
          Parla con noi
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ─── OVERVIEW ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-white reveal">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
          <div>
            <p class="text-blue-600 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Panoramica</p>
            <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-5 leading-tight">
              Un brand di design premium alla ricerca di una crescita scalabile e redditizia
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
              Il nostro cliente è un brand di articoli per la casa design-oriented con una base di clienti fedele
              e un forte brand equity. Con un focus sulla crescita sostenibile e redditizia, ha cercato di
              sfruttare il pieno potenziale del canale affiliate — scalando i ricavi senza sacrificare i margini
              o la qualità dei clienti.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-blue-100 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-blue-50 transition-all duration-300">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Focus sull'efficienza</div>
                <div class="text-sm text-gray-500">Massimizzare i ricavi per ogni euro speso, non solo il volume</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-blue-100 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-blue-50 transition-all duration-300">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M12 1v4M12 19v4M4.22 4.22l2.83 2.83M16.95 16.95l2.83 2.83M1 12h4M19 12h4M4.22 19.78l2.83-2.83M16.95 7.05l2.83-2.83"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Migliorare la qualità del traffico</div>
                <div class="text-sm text-gray-500">Attrarre visitatori ad alta intenzione d'acquisto, più propensi a convertire e fidelizzarsi</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-blue-100 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-blue-50 transition-all duration-300">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"/><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Aumentare i ricavi incrementali</div>
                <div class="text-sm text-gray-500">Far crescere i ricavi netti attribuibili al canale affiliate</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ─── CHALLENGE ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-gray-50 reveal">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
        <p class="text-blue-600 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">La Sfida</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 max-w-2xl leading-tight">
          Navigare le tensioni fondamentali della crescita affiliate
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-500 mb-12 max-w-xl">Tre sfide strutturali che hanno richiesto un approccio deliberato e guidato dalla strategia.</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">

          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-blue-100 transition-all duration-300 group">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 group-hover:bg-blue-600 text-blue-600 group-hover:text-white flex items-center justify-center mb-5 transition-colors duration-300">
              <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"/><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-lg">Redditività prima del volume</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Aumentare il GMV mantenendo i margini ha richiesto una selezione rigorosa dei partner e l'ottimizzazione delle commissioni.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-blue-100 transition-all duration-300 group">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 group-hover:bg-blue-600 text-blue-600 group-hover:text-white flex items-center justify-center mb-5 transition-colors duration-300">
              <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"/><line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-lg">Rischio di traffico a bassa intenzione</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">I partner con coupon e incentivi possono generare alto volume ma clienti di bassa qualità con scarso valore nel tempo.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-blue-100 transition-all duration-300 group">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 group-hover:bg-blue-600 text-blue-600 group-hover:text-white flex items-center justify-center mb-5 transition-colors duration-300">
              <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-lg">Bilanciare acquisizione ed efficienza</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Trovare il giusto mix tra acquisizione di nuovi clienti e massimizzazione dei ricavi da utenti ad alta intenzione esistenti.</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ─── STRATEGY ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-white reveal">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
        <p class="text-blue-600 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Il Nostro Approccio</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight max-w-2xl">
          Una strategia di precisione costruita per performance sostenibili
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-500 mb-14 max-w-xl">Tre pilastri interconnessi che lavorano insieme per guidare una crescita di qualità su scala.</p>

        <div class="space-y-5">
          <div class="flex gap-6 sm:gap-8 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-blue-100 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-50/60 transition-all duration-300">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">01</div>
            <div class="flex-1">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                <svg class="text-blue-600" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Qualità dei partner prima della quantità</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Abbiamo curato una rete selettiva di content creator, editori e siti di comparazione ad alta intenzione — privilegiando partner il cui pubblico si allinea al profilo del cliente ideale del brand. Il volume non era mai l'obiettivo; la qualità della conversione sì.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex gap-6 sm:gap-8 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-blue-100 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-50/60 transition-all duration-300">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">02</div>
            <div class="flex-1">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                <svg class="text-blue-600" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/></svg>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Ottimizzazione della conversione</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">La qualità del traffico è solo metà dell'equazione. Abbiamo lavorato per allineare il traffico affiliate alle landing page e alle offerte con le migliori performance — assicurando che i click arrivassero nel contesto giusto per convertire con la massima efficienza.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex gap-6 sm:gap-8 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-blue-100 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-50/60 transition-all duration-300">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">03</div>
            <div class="flex-1">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                <svg class="text-blue-600" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"/></svg>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Analisi continua delle performance</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Le revisioni delle performance settimanali e mensili ci hanno permesso di riallocare il budget dinamicamente — scalando i partner top performer, mettendo in pausa quelli sotto-performanti e affinando continuamente il mix per massimizzare ROAS e AOV.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ─── RESULTS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-gray-50 reveal">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
        <p class="text-blue-600 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Risultati</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">I numeri parlano da soli</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-500 mb-14 max-w-xl">Performance del canale affiliate misurate su tre periodi rispetto alla media del sito.</p>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 mb-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Valore Medio dell'Ordine — Affiliate vs. Media del Sito</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-9">I clienti affiliate spendono costantemente di più per ordine rispetto alla media generale del sito.</p>
          <div class="space-y-8">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
                <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700">2025</span>
                <span class="text-sm font-bold text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">+5,86% AOV più alto</span>
              </div>
              <div class="space-y-2">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                  <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 w-16 shrink-0">Media sito</span>
                  <div class="flex-1 bg-gray-100 rounded-full h-2.5"><div class="bg-gray-300 h-2.5 rounded-full" style="width: 68%"></div></div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                  <span class="text-xs text-blue-600 font-semibold w-16 shrink-0">Affiliate</span>
                  <div class="flex-1 bg-blue-50 rounded-full h-2.5"><div class="bg-blue-600 h-2.5 rounded-full" style="width: 72%"></div></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
                <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700">Ultimi 12 Mesi</span>
                <span class="text-sm font-bold text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">+9,49% AOV più alto</span>
              </div>
              <div class="space-y-2">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                  <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 w-16 shrink-0">Media sito</span>
                  <div class="flex-1 bg-gray-100 rounded-full h-2.5"><div class="bg-gray-300 h-2.5 rounded-full" style="width: 65%"></div></div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                  <span class="text-xs text-blue-600 font-semibold w-16 shrink-0">Affiliate</span>
                  <div class="flex-1 bg-blue-50 rounded-full h-2.5"><div class="bg-blue-600 h-2.5 rounded-full" style="width: 71%"></div></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
                <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700">Anno in Corso</span>
                <span class="text-sm font-bold text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">+14,61% AOV più alto</span>
              </div>
              <div class="space-y-2">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                  <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 w-16 shrink-0">Media sito</span>
                  <div class="flex-1 bg-gray-100 rounded-full h-2.5"><div class="bg-gray-300 h-2.5 rounded-full" style="width: 63%"></div></div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                  <span class="text-xs text-blue-600 font-semibold w-16 shrink-0">Affiliate</span>
                  <div class="flex-1 bg-blue-50 rounded-full h-2.5"><div class="bg-blue-600 h-2.5 rounded-full" style="width: 72%"></div></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Incremento del Tasso di Conversione</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">Il traffico affiliate converte oltre 3× la media del sito.</p>
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-4 border-b border-gray-50">
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-500">2025</span>
                <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600">+233%</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-4 border-b border-gray-50">
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-500">Ultimi 12 Mesi</span>
                <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600">+265%</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-4">
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-500">Anno in Corso</span>
                <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600">+229%</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-[#0a1228] rounded-2xl p-8 border border-white/5">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-1">Ritorno sulla Spesa Pubblicitaria</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-8">Eccezionale efficienza del capitale in tutti i periodi.</p>
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-4 border-b border-white/5">
                <span class="text-sm text-slate-400">2025</span>
                <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-blue-400">15,81x</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-4 border-b border-white/5">
                <span class="text-sm text-slate-400">Ultimi 12 Mesi</span>
                <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-blue-400">16,06x</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-4">
                <span class="text-sm text-slate-400">Anno in Corso</span>
                <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-blue-400">16,31x</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ─── CUSTOMER MIX ───────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-white reveal">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
        <p class="text-blue-600 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Mix di Clienti e Impatto</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
          L'affiliate guida sia l'acquisizione che la conversione
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-500 mb-14 max-w-xl">Il canale offre un sano equilibrio tra acquisizione di nuovi clienti e intenzione d'acquisto ad alta conversione.</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-100">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Clienti Nuovi vs. Ricorrenti</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">L'affiliate punta fortemente all'acquisizione di nuovi clienti.</p>
            <div class="space-y-6">
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5">
                  <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">Media Sito (Shopify)</span>
                  <span class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-600">~92% nuovi</span>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-3"><div class="bg-gray-400 h-3 rounded-full" style="width: 92%"></div></div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5">
                  <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">Canale Affiliate</span>
                  <span class="text-sm font-bold text-blue-600">~84% nuovi</span>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full bg-blue-50 rounded-full h-3"><div class="bg-blue-600 h-3 rounded-full" style="width: 84%"></div></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-6 leading-relaxed">L'affiliate mantiene una forte acquisizione di nuovi clienti offrendo anche un tasso leggermente più alto di clienti ricorrenti — indicando allineamento con il brand e traffico di alta qualità.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-100">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Contributo ai Nuovi Utenti</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">La quota affiliate dei nuovi clienti totali nei vari periodi.</p>
            <div class="space-y-6">
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5">
                  <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">2025</span>
                  <span class="text-sm font-bold text-blue-600">37% dei nuovi utenti</span>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full bg-blue-50 rounded-full h-3"><div class="bg-blue-600 h-3 rounded-full" style="width: 37%"></div></div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5">
                  <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">Ultimi 12 Mesi</span>
                  <span class="text-sm font-bold text-blue-600">40% dei nuovi utenti</span>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full bg-blue-50 rounded-full h-3"><div class="bg-blue-600 h-3 rounded-full" style="width: 40%"></div></div>
              </div>
